          { "@type": "Question", "name": "Which brand has better flavor?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Subjective. ZYN has broader appeal; Skruf's flavors are bolder. ZYN's coffee range is unique; Skruf's Nordic Licorice is iconic." } },
          { "@type": "Question", "name": "Can I find Skruf outside Sweden?", "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, but you may need to order online. ZYN is easier to find in physical shops outside Scandinavia." } }
        ]
      })} />

      <p style="font-size: 13px; color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground)); margin-top: 32px; font-style: italic;">
        Disclaimer: This article is for informational purposes only and does not constitute medical advice. Nicotine is an addictive substance. If you have health concerns about nicotine use, consult a qualified healthcare professional.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
